4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3_n1P6mtqZ0Q7kNvwHi1-Hi&_nc_oc=AdoDpB6nyPVsBBL4MY1gWbjLYBsu3Gv5-kt1QqEaHnmKGesLYDcQcrnyiHDl7PuLx7I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKOsvzj2l2tJ2bFaI3esFjtsKog7VSDoU4Y3TsJjLvjbQ&oe=6AB12B54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zoSn_uMjxEUQ7kNvwGC6RmI&_nc_oc=AdrsUiaOEI2Pq1MrVFap5mi5gdL9G9JooRoXYCliH2fhEkez9-QNP6SYPn54lv6ta7Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIP1mQ-CiOteZ4_HjO3Wmkrl6WubAFR6TIrNzbD-034Cw&oe=6AB13032"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TarE-P9p4KwQ7kNvwEuDm6q&_nc_oc=Adp_UEse6YMLWJAt2JD_RVoNc6z0EnyVoY3gEU7xSth2TP-wtE2PxhQTOLUhShbDK3M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJJJus5zADdbfHL7uDxwtCtEBFM7iQc5L60ox9KbQdn1w&oe=6AB13DD5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p